{"term": {"label": "親", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "作", "id": "作"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "同", "id": "同"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "妻子", "id": "妻子"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "殘", "id": "殘"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "流", "id": "流"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "親", "variants": [], "id": "親"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "誅", "id": "誅"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}, {"form": "遊", "id": "遊"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.0860335064612496, "source": "親", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.69547141889535, "source": "親", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 2.9831534913471307, "source": "親", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 1.3409257560900396, "source": "親", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.2423134674219299, "source": "下", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.2900063107871858, "source": "下", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.066862759472976, "source": "下", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 2.066862759472976, "source": "下", "target": "流"}, {"weight": 1.8845412026790211, "source": "下", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 1.8845412026790211, "source": "下", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 2.5776883832389665, "source": "下", "target": "殘"}, {"weight": 3.1654750481410856, "source": "從", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.942331496826876, "source": "從", "target": "流"}, {"weight": 2.066862759472976, "source": "從", "target": "上"}, {"weig